<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ROHR estimates said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ROHR estimates said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns cut the fiscal year 1997 estimate for Rohr Inc to $0.90/shr from $1.00, a Wall Street source said</p>
<p>-- FY 98 eps view cut to $1.30/shr from $1.40-source</p>
<p>-- Analyst said FY Q2 earnings reported February 26 were $0.04 below consensus view excluding impact of favorable resolution on two contract claims</p>
</text>
